8-Week Project Execution Plan: Dynamic Spatio-Temporal GNN for Real-Time Fraud Topology & AML

This document provides a comprehensive week-by-week implementation roadmap for the **Dynamic Spatio-Temporal Graph Neural Network (ST-GNN) for Real-Time Fraud Topology & Anti-Money Laundering (AML)** project[cite: 1]. It is structured for an 8-week academic or development cycle, taking the system from raw data ingestion to a zero-cost production deployment sustaining 50 to 100 Transactions Per Second (TPS)[cite: 1].

